<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n90435" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσωπο-ποιία</span></b> , ἡ,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>dramatization, the putting
				of speeches into the mouths of characters</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Po.</u>
				5.12
			</span></i> (pl.), <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				<u>Vett. Cens.</u>
				3.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Demetr.
				<u>Eloc.</u>
				265
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Marcellin.
				<u>Vit. Thuc.</u>
				38
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Herm.
				<u>in Phdr.</u>
				p.182
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				A.
			</span></i>; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠθοποιία</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Hermog.
				<u>Prog.</u>
				9
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>the putting of imaginary speeches into one's own</i> or
				<i>another's mouth</i> ('I should have said . .', 'your father
			would have said . .'), <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Inv.</u>
				3.10
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				15
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Charis.
				p.284
			</span></i> K., <i><span class="en">
				Rutil.
				2.6
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>change of grammatical person</i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.D.
				<u>Adv.</u>
				131.16
			</span></i>.</div>
